                                "sense_id": "754c2b29-0093-3309-baaf-131aa9b3597c",
                                "text": "It was ordered that his residencia be taken in secret by the new viceroy, and a public investigation proclaimed and concluded within forty days. The marquis refused to hold a secret residencia, alleging that it was necessary for Revilla Gigedo to depart for Spain previous to taking any steps in the matter."
